v1 => v2

Cleared up some stuff in the spec.
Retracted SAF from IETF RFCs to allow for constant iteration.
Added `sample_type` and `version` fields.

v2 => v3
Made `saf_header_t` a packed struct.

v3 => v3.0.1
Fixed `SAF_VERSION_PACK` macro.
Removed "this is a breaking change" lines.  
Created changelog, information before this version may be innacurate and is provided to the best of my memory.
Added clarification on multiple things including:
- encoding of multi-byte values
- ZStandard parameters (now explicitly implementation defined)
- interleaving order of PCM samples